-alpha&amp;.v=1495217791009\" class=\"ir feature-img ir\" /\u003E\n\t\t\u003C/div\u003E\n\t\t\u003Cdiv\u003E\n        \t\u003Cdiv\u003E\n\u003Ch2 class=\"as-accessoryoverlay-heading\" id=\"${id}-overlayHeading\"\u003E\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ${title}\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"as-accessoryoverlay-price\"\u003E\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ${price}\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\t\t\t\u003Cdiv class=\"as-accessoryoverlay-description\"\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\u003Cp class=\"pd-overlay-subcopy\"\u003E每部 iPhone 均隨附一年硬件維修的\u003Ca href=\"https://www.apple.com/hk/en/legal/warranty\" data-feature-name=\"Astro Link\" data-display-name=\"AOS: www.apple.com/hk/en/legal/warranty\" target=\"new\"\u003E有限保障\u003C/a\u003E以及長達 \u003Ca href=\"https://www.apple.com/hk/en/support/complimentary\" data-feature-name=\"Astro Link\" data-display-name=\"AOS: www.apple.com/hk/en/support/complimentary\" target=\"new\"\u003E90 日免費技術支援\u003C/a\u003E。適用於 iPhone 的 AppleCare+ 服務計劃將保障期限延長至自你購買 AppleCare+ 服務計劃的日期起計的兩年，並提供不限次數的意外損壞保障服務。詳情請參閱\u003Ca href=\"https://www.apple.com/hk/legal/sales-support/applecare/applecareplus/apac-tzh\" data-feature-name=\"Astro Link\" data-display-name=\"AOS: www.apple.com/hk/legal/sales-support/applecare/applecareplus/apac-tzh\" target=\"new\"\u003E條款\u003C/a\u003E。\u003C/p\u003E\n\t\t\t\u003C/div\u003E\n\t\t\t\u003Cdiv class=\"as-accessoryoverlay-learnmore\"\u003E\n                \u003Cp class=\"pd-overlay-link\"\u003E\n    \u003Ca href=\"https://www.apple.com/hk/support/products/iphone\" data-feature-name=\"Astro Link\" data-display-name=\"AOS: support/products/iphone\" class=\"icon icon-after icon-external\" target=\"_blank\"\u003E進一步了解 AppleCare+ 服務計劃\u003Cspan class=\"visuallyhidden\"\u003E(以新視窗開啟)\u003C/span\u003E\n \u003C/a\u003E \n\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E查看 AppleCare 服務計劃所有費用的完整列表，請\u003Ca href=\"http://apple.com/hk/legal/applecare/fees-deductibles\" data-feature-name=\"Astro Link\" data-display-name=\"AOS: apple.com/hk/legal/applecare/fees-deductibles\" target=\"_blank\"\u003E按此\u003Cspan class=\"visuallyhidden\"\u003E(以新視窗開啟)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/a\u003E。每次維修或更換須收取服務費。\u003C/p\u003E\n            \u003C/div\u003E\n        \u003C/div\u003E\n\t\u003C/div\u003E\n    \u003Cdiv class=\"as-accessoryoverlay-chat\"\u003E\n        \u003Cdiv class=\"as-chat\"\u003E\n            \u003Cdiv\u003E獲取購物協助。 \u003Cspan\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"as-chat-inline\"\u003E\u003Ca href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"as-chat-button\"\u003E即時對話\u003Cspan class=\"a11y\"\u003E(以新視窗開啟)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/a\u003E或致電 \u003C/span\u003E\u003Ca href=\"tel:800-908-988\"\u003E800-908-988\u003C/a\u003E。\u003C/span\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n        \u003C/div\u003E\n    \u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E","alt":"AppleCare (紅色 Apple 標誌)","src":"https://store.storeimages.cdn-apple.com/1/as-images.apple.com/is/APPLECARE-plus_ICON?wid=800&hei=800&fmt=webp&qlt=90&fit=constrain&.v=NCtyMU9JdVpIVnJwaHNhN0RoQytrbHBLMzlLdW0zb1ZjUGpUUE1kYUlMZHZPaWhpZEx5eWZNMXF1S0xEMUVSbzltL1NSWVF4eU0yK0ozVG10L3E2d25iMjF4RmlZZXZVcEFBNVZkS1k0VUY4bzhjYTlKRDBSTFZ3YzlieG9MeSs&traceId=1","title":"AppleCare+ 服務計劃適用於 iPhone 18 Pro Max","AppleCareEvar1":"InLineRecommendation||SHJ63","isAppleCare":true,"id":"cart-items-item-19ed522a-bd34-4ecb-8fd7-2f20d44cf168-inlineRecommendations-sHJ63ZX/A","learnMoreLink":"https://www.apple.com/hk/support/products/iphone/","details":"\u003Cul class=\"as-form-choiceselectordesc-list\" role=\"list\"\u003E\n\t\u003Cli class=\"as-form-choiceselectordesc-listitem\" role=\"listitem\"\u003E\n\t不限維修次數的意外損壞保障\u003Csup\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"visuallyhidden\"\u003E註腳\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/sup\u003E\n\t\u003C/li\u003E\n\t\u003Cli class=\"as-form-choiceselectordesc-listitem\" role=\"listitem\"\u003E\n\tApple 認證的維修服務使用 Apple 原廠零件\n\t\u003C/li\u003E\n\t\u003Cli class=\"as-form-choiceselectordesc-listitem\" role=\"listitem\"\u003E\n\t優先聯絡 Apple 專家\n\t\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E","priceA11y":"HK$1,799","sources":[{"srcSet":"https://store.storeim